d 'CTOCLIENT': module providing client for the SurveyCTO API
d
d    ctoclient downloads data from a SurveyCTO server into Stata
d through the SurveyCTO REST API. It is the Stata companion of the
d R    package ctoclient by the same author, and uses consistent
d command names. 
d
d KW: data management
d KW: CTO
d KW: survey data
d
d Requires: Stata version 15 and curl
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260925
d
d Author:  Gutama Girja Urago,    Laterite
d Support: email gurago@@laterite.com
d
f cto_form_data.ado
f cto_form_data_attachment.ado
f ctoclient.sthlp
f cto_form_data.sthlp
f cto_form_data_attachment.sthlp
